WEBVTT

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.980
This is a work of fiction based on research into the period in which it is set. The people,
 organization, laws, and names that appear in it have no relation to any in the real world.

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.600
How good to see the moon!

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.900
She is like a little piece of money,

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:26.270
a little silver flower.

00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:30.060
She is cold and chaste.

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:33.060
I am sure she is a virgin.

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:37.190
The Lord hath come.

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:40.060
The son of man hath come.

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:42.020
Who was that who cried out?

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:44.940
The prophet, Princess.

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:49.100
Ah, the prophet! He of whom
the Tetrarch is afraid?

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:50.810
It is thy mouth...

00:00:53.230 --> 00:00:57.850
To kiss thy mouth, my lips to thy lips,
my words to thy words.

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:03.230
Would you please be my co-star, mister?

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:30.190
Taisho 12 (1923)
Early summer
Tokyo Station

00:01:35.560 --> 00:01:38.060
Are you Major Yoshinobu Maeda?

00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:45.310
And you are?

00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:48.520
Moriyama of Special Forces Unit 16.

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:53.100
I have orders to welcome you
from Lieutenant General Nakajima, Major.

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:55.810
If we're going to headquarters, I can walk.

00:01:55.810 --> 00:01:58.190
We aren't going to headquarters today.

00:01:58.190 --> 00:02:00.980
My orders are to take you to Tsukishima Island.

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:01.980
Tsukishima?

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:07.010
Dawn

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:12.150
They can't cross water.

00:04:12.150 --> 00:04:14.480
Clever.

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:16.600
And the vamp?

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:19.400
The vamp target is a stage actress.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:23.480
Six days ago, she suffered near-fatal
injuries in an accident on stage,

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:25.600
but her injuries healed in four hours.

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:27.350
Special forces was called.

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:32.100
The vamp was taken into custody
on Lieutenant General Nakajima's orders.

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:33.190
Her symptoms?

00:04:33.190 --> 00:04:35.190
Have not yet been confirmed.

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:36.270
Her mental state?

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:38.810
Conversation is sometimes possible.

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:41.190
Can we bring her to our side?

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:44.560
That decision is entirely in your hands, Major.

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:47.100
Understood.

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:48.730
It's certainly deep.

00:04:48.730 --> 00:04:51.560
I'm told it will be flooded in an emergency.

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:56.310
What do you think of Tokyo
after six months away?

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:01.230
The Imperial Hotel renovations
will finish this summer.

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:04.940
Wouldn't you love to stay a night
in a first-class hotel like that?

00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:06.060
Moriyama.

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:07.650
What is it, Major?

00:05:07.650 --> 00:05:10.600
You're awfully talkative
for a special forces man.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:13.310
Sorry. My wife said the same thing.

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:17.230
"You're a born chatterbox,
so you've got to be careful."

00:05:17.230 --> 00:05:19.230
You're married?

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:22.600
We had our wedding this spring.

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:25.150
We're childhood friends.

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:27.730
A newlywed, huh?

00:05:27.730 --> 00:05:32.480
It's only been three months, but my folks
are already pestering us for grandkids.

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:34.690
Are you single, Major?

00:05:34.690 --> 00:05:37.730
I have a fiancée I've never met.

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:53.230
More stairs?

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:04.600
Ready, Major?

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:05.900
Open it.

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:31.020
Look up.

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:42.520
What did you send?

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:44.060
A play script.

00:06:44.060 --> 00:06:47.350
I was ordered to give her things
from before her infection.

00:06:47.350 --> 00:06:49.730
What a strange voice!

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:52.520
I would look closer at him.

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:55.520
I must look at him closer.

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:58.900
Where is her voice coming from?

00:06:56.900 --> 00:07:01.350
I am Salomé, daughter of Herodias,
Princess of Judea.

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:00.060
The recording?

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:01.350
It's running.

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:12.440
Speak again, Jokanaan.

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:22.690
How good to see the moon!

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:28.600
She is like a little piece of money,

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:31.310
a little silver flower.

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:35.900
She is cold and chaste.

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:38.850
I am sure she is a virgin.

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:42.810
The Lord hath come.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:45.810
The son of man hath come.

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:48.020
Who was that who cried out?

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:51.230
The prophet, Princess.

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:55.440
Ah, the prophet! He of whom
the Tetrarch is afraid?

00:07:55.440 --> 00:07:57.230
It is thy mouth...

00:07:57.230 --> 00:07:59.560
Following our victories in the Great War,

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:04.770
Western technology and culture are
steadily becoming a part of our country.

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:09.560
The navy boasts that it's invincible,
and I have no intention of silencing it.

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:10.480
However--

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:13.100
All that prosper must decline?

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:16.650
That's becoming your pet phrase, Okimura.

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:18.600
Nakajima,

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:22.060
I have high hopes for your vampire unit plan.

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:24.400
A secret tactic of the British Empire.

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:27.150
I like the way you think.

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:28.940
Still...

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:30.980
If you don't produce results,

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:37.270
even as secretary, I can't convince
a cabinet leaning toward arms reduction.

00:08:37.270 --> 00:08:40.770
Well, that is a problem.

00:08:40.770 --> 00:08:42.400
Jokanaan,

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:45.600
thou wert the only man that I have loved.

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:47.560
All other men are hateful to me.

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:51.270
But thou, thou wert beautiful!

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:08.650
Major Maeda,

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:11.100
Lieutenant General Nakajima is waiting.

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:12.480
Understood.

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:18.150
I'm waiting, too.

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:26.650
Thine eyes that were so terrible,
so full of rage and scorn, are shut now.

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:28.400
Art thou afraid of me?

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:30.100
Thy tongue...

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:31.270
Moriyama.

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:32.980
What is it, Major?

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:35.270
What do you think?

00:09:35.270 --> 00:09:37.060
I don't know.

00:09:37.060 --> 00:09:39.900
I still haven't seen the real thing.

00:09:39.900 --> 00:09:42.480
But she had stigmata on her tongue.

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:45.150
That mark appears at the point of infection.

00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:50.980
That may be, but is she really our enemy?

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:54.480
That doesn't agree with what I know.

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:57.730
I was the same, at first.

00:09:57.730 --> 00:10:01.560
But they have the potential
to become our enemies.

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:04.020
If we waver, we could join them.

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:06.980
We're still here, on this side.

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:17.060
Major Maeda, Special Forces Unit 16.

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:28.100
Major Maeda, reporting.

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:32.850
Yoshinobu Maeda has returned
to Special Forces Unit 16.

00:10:32.850 --> 00:10:36.520
Sorry to call you back three days early.

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:38.730
How is your arm?

00:10:38.730 --> 00:10:39.770
I can use it.

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:40.730
I see.

00:10:40.730 --> 00:10:42.310
And Tsukishima?

00:10:42.310 --> 00:10:44.940
As far as I can judge from the circumstances,

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:47.600
her vital functions ceased due to the accident.

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:50.270
Given that her memories
are stuck in that moment,

00:10:50.270 --> 00:10:53.650
it's probable that she was
infected shortly thereafter.

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:56.350
And what's your opinion?

00:10:56.350 --> 00:10:58.020
Communication is difficult.

00:10:58.020 --> 00:11:02.400
I believe the possibility that she
can be trained as an agent is... slim.

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:05.270
Shall we dispose of her?

00:11:05.270 --> 00:11:08.480
Dispose of her, sir?

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:11.480
Maeda, pity will cloud your judgment.

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:13.980
Yes, sir. I am aware.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:19.400
She's an extremely rare specimen
of the highest rank, but we have no choice.

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:19.110
"Kinzo Takenaka" "Tokuzo Yamashita" "Saburo Fuwa"
"Taro Kuriyama"  "Misaki Tsukishima" "Yoshiro Masuda"

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:20.560
The highest rank?

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:23.190
Then, she was infected by...

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:27.940
One even higher.
An ancient dweller of the night.

00:11:27.940 --> 00:11:33.190
Come to think of it, we've had reports
of unconfirmed vamps attacking humans.

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:34.400
The victims?

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:35.310
Three.

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:37.560
Two were found dead from poisoning.

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:39.980
The last one is on Tsukishima Island.

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:42.980
So, she's our only lead?

00:11:42.980 --> 00:11:45.100
Will you mobilize Zero?

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:48.480
No, I'll have a special forces team
search during the day.

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:50.690
We only have one chance.

00:11:50.690 --> 00:11:53.980
I'll begin by identifying
where the vamp was infected.

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:56.900
I leave the Tsukishima issue
entirely in your hands.

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:59.230
If you judge her unnecessary...

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:01.980
I will dispose of her immediately.

00:12:01.980 --> 00:12:05.020
Good. I'm counting on you.

00:12:05.020 --> 00:12:09.940
Thy tongue, that was like a red snake
darting poison, it moves no more.

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:16.480
I will kiss thy mouth, Jokanaan.

00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:22.310
Special Forces Unit 16 will search
for an individual hiding in Tokyo.

00:12:22.310 --> 00:12:24.520
You are to discover their hiding place.

00:12:24.520 --> 00:12:27.730
Don't rush to capture them;
the task force will do that.

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:29.730
You already know the search area.

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:30.730
Dismissed!

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:32.650
Yes, sir!

00:12:32.650 --> 00:12:34.350
What will we do, Major?

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:36.560
Question the vamp on Tsukishima.

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:37.730
Yes, sir.

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:43.520
How good to see the moon!

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:46.980
A little silver flower.

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:46.570
Ms. Misaki
Nakajima

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:53.270
She is cold and chaste.

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:55.310
Who was that who cried out?

00:12:55.310 --> 00:12:59.150
Ah, the prophet! He of whom
the Tetrarch is afraid?

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:01.150
It is thy mouth...

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:05.690
To kiss thy mouth, my lips to thy lips,
my words to thy words.

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:07.520
What cute handwriting.

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:12.520
Excuse me!

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:14.350
What is it?

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:17.190
I'd like you to sign this.

00:13:18.350 --> 00:13:22.810
Also, it's time for the
special forces unit training.

00:13:22.810 --> 00:13:24.690
I want to go somewhere else first.

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:25.810
Where?

00:13:25.810 --> 00:13:27.980
The Imperial Theater.

00:13:27.980 --> 00:13:30.560
Take care.

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:34.480
Bring forth this prophet.

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:47.260
Imperial Theater

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:47.260
Salomé

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:19.270
Sir, this performance has ended.

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:26.850
I see that.

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:30.190
The end of a play is the end of a dream.

00:14:30.190 --> 00:14:36.600
The audience passes through the doors
of the underworld and returns to this life.

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:40.940
Please leave, and take care
not to leave your heart here.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:42.850
You speak Japanese well.

00:14:42.850 --> 00:14:44.600
I'm an actor.

00:14:44.600 --> 00:14:47.520
Learning words is my specialty.

00:14:47.520 --> 00:14:49.850
What's your name?

00:14:49.850 --> 00:14:51.900
Jokanaan.

00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:53.850
The prophet in Salomé?

00:14:53.850 --> 00:14:55.310
You're well-informed.

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:56.520
Oh, well.

00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:59.560
I'm Defrott, an actor employed here.

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:02.770
I hear an actress had
an accident in this theater.

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:04.230
Are you a policeman, sir?

00:15:04.230 --> 00:15:06.350
You don't seem like a reporter.

00:15:06.350 --> 00:15:08.400
Something like that.

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:09.850
It was a terrible accident.

00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:14.600
A large prop fell on top of her
during an evening rehearsal.

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:17.650
She was playing Salomé.

00:15:17.650 --> 00:15:19.100
I know.

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:20.150
I see.

00:15:20.150 --> 00:15:23.770
In that case, there's nothing I can tell you.

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:26.770
Wait, there is one thing.

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:33.650
She was very excited
to show her Salomé to her lover.

00:15:33.650 --> 00:15:38.520
It's a shame; if only he'd come back
a little sooner, she could have shown him.

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:40.020
Excuse me.

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:50.220
Yoshinobu Maeda is daily in good...

00:15:50.770 --> 00:15:52.480
I'm leaving.

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:02.150
Excuse me, do you work here?

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:07.190
Misaki.

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:09.150
Oh, I get that a lot!

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:11.940
People say I look like Misaki, who plays Salomé.

00:16:11.940 --> 00:16:15.480
By the way, could you get me into the theater?

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:16.480
No.

00:16:16.480 --> 00:16:19.150
No, huh?

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:22.150
I'm Aoi Shirase with the Nitto News.

00:16:22.150 --> 00:16:25.060
Please let me know if
anything happens, anything at all.

00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:27.400
No. Goodbye.

00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:28.560
Seriously?

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:30.270
Couldn't you be nicer?

00:16:32.730 --> 00:16:33.900
Major!

00:16:33.900 --> 00:16:35.270
The vamp escaped!

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:55.600
Station contacts in formation I.

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:58.940
Set a watch on the streets
from Kojimachi to Kyobashi.

00:16:58.940 --> 00:17:01.020
Find the suspect, then track her.

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:03.480
Don't apprehend her; wait for my order.

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:04.690
Understood.

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:08.020
How good to see the moon!

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:09.230
She is like...

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:27.440
Speak again, Jokanaan.

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:31.310
Thy voice is as music to mine ear.

00:17:33.270 --> 00:17:36.900
I will give thee all that is mine,

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:40.730
save for the life of one man.

00:17:40.730 --> 00:17:46.060
Ah, the prophet! He of whom
the Tetrarch is afraid?

00:17:46.060 --> 00:17:47.440
It is thy mouth...

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:51.270
It is to speak with thee that I desire.

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:58.350
To kiss thy mouth, my lips to thy lips,
my words to thy words.

00:17:58.350 --> 00:18:02.730
It is thy mouth that I desire, Jokanaan.

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:08.060
Misaki.

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:12.230
They're all injured,
but their lives aren't in danger.

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:16.310
We have a telegram that the enemy
was sighted at 0344 Shinohashi.

00:18:16.310 --> 00:18:18.440
She'll remain active until dawn.

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:21.480
Limit the search area to east of Tokyo Station.

00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:22.650
Yes, sir!

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:30.150
Yoshinobu Maeda, there are
two roads open to you.

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:45.310
Misaki.

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:48.350
Thou wouldst not suffer me to kiss thy mouth.

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:52.600
Well! I will kiss it now.

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:56.770
I will bite it with my teeth
as one bites a ripe fruit.

00:19:56.770 --> 00:20:02.400
Thine eyes that were so terrible,
so full of rage and scorn, are shut now.

00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:04.980
Art thou afraid of me?

00:20:04.980 --> 00:20:10.520
Thy tongue, that was like a red snake
darting poison, it moves no more.

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:13.190
Thy head belongs to me.

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:16.230
I can do with it what I will.

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:20.310
Jokanaan, thou wert the
only man that I have loved.

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:22.270
All other men are hateful to me.

00:20:22.270 --> 00:20:25.940
But thou, thou wert beautiful!

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:37.310
Hello, I'm Misaki.

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:41.270
I've wanted to meet you for such a long time.

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:56.520
I'm glad you're just how I imagined.

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:58.730
Misaki!

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:02.980
I wanted to kiss you in the end.

00:21:25.770 --> 00:21:28.730
And then Salomé

00:21:28.730 --> 00:21:31.900
was killed by the Tetrarch.

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:40.730
The vamp was incinerated by sunlight
in Marunouchi Plaza at Tokyo Station.

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:43.100
I confirmed that she turned to ash.

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:45.690
Well done.

00:21:45.690 --> 00:21:47.690
Now,

00:21:47.690 --> 00:21:52.560
Major Yoshinobu Maeda,
you are hereby promoted two ranks.

00:21:52.560 --> 00:21:58.560
You are to assume command of Special Forces
Unit 16, also known as Code Zero.

00:21:58.560 --> 00:22:03.270
Your mission is the apprehension
or disposal of vampires hiding in Japan.

00:22:03.270 --> 00:22:06.100
You need not repeat it. That is all.

00:22:08.100 --> 00:22:10.940
Colonel Maeda, reporting for duty.

00:23:42.060 --> 00:23:47.070
Till Death Do Us Part
